{"id":1104,"date":"2026-08-20T19:45:33","date_gmt":"2026-08-20T19:45:33","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1104"},"modified":"2026-08-20T20:30:12","modified_gmt":"2026-08-20T20:30:12","slug":"beta-wordart","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/wordart\/beta-wordart\/","title":{"rendered":"Beta WordArt"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Beta WordArt<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1107\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BetaWordArt.webp\" alt=\"Beta WordArt\" width=\"97\" height=\"95\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BetaWordArt.webp 407w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BetaWordArt-300x293.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 97px) 100vw, 97px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Beta WordArt generates decorative text as high-fidelity PNG images using a hardware-accelerated Canvas 2D pipeline. The output is pixel-perfect across all browsers, PDFs, and physical prints &#8211; what you see on screen is exactly what you get in your exported document.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Inserting Beta WordArt<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1115\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/InsertingBetaWordArt.webp\" alt=\"Inserting Beta WordArt\" width=\"98\" height=\"103\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/InsertingBetaWordArt.webp 428w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/InsertingBetaWordArt-284x300.webp 284w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 98px) 100vw, 98px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To insert Beta WordArt:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Insert &gt; WordArt (BETA)<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The WordArt Generator modal opens. The grid of 500+ style thumbnails loads instantly &#8211; the modal caches its layout so subsequent openings take no time at all<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1112\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-205217.png\" alt=\"Inserting Beta WordArt GUI\" width=\"451\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-205217.png 1015w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-205217-300x240.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-20-205217-768x615.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 451px) 100vw, 451px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Type your text into the input field at the top of the modal.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Browse the style gallery. Thumbnails render asynchronously in the background so the modal opens immediately without any delay.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Single-click to preview a style. Double-click to confirm your selection and insert.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Your WordArt is inserted as a transparent PNG onto the canvas, with a selection box that shrink-wraps precisely around the text and shadow &#8211; no oversized bounding boxes.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Style Library<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The style library contains 500+ presets spanning a wide range of creative categories:<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1118\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheStyleLibrbry.webp\" alt=\"The Style Library\" width=\"99\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheStyleLibrbry.webp 423w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheStyleLibrbry-286x300.webp 286w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 99px) 100vw, 99px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Classic 90s &#8211;<\/strong> Rainbow gradients, 3D blue extrusions, silver chrome, wavy purple.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Modern &amp; Minimal &#8211;<\/strong> Clean shadows, thin metallic outlines, flat solid fills.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Neon &amp; Glow &#8211;<\/strong> Neon wireframes, electric glow halos, cyberpunk outlines.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Holographic &amp; Iridescent &#8211;<\/strong> Glass-like prismatic gradients, holographic foil effects.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Vaporwave &amp; Retro &#8211;<\/strong> Sunset gradients, synthwave purples, pastel 80s palettes.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>3D &amp; Depth &#8211;<\/strong> Extruded letter stacks, bevelled edges, cast shadow layers.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Curved &amp; Arched &#8211;<\/strong> Arch Up, Arch Down, Wave, Sine Wave, Zig-Zag, Triangle peak.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>High Contrast &#8211;<\/strong> Bold outlines, caution-tape designs, checkerboard fills.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Curved Text Paths<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1119\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ShapePaths.webp\" alt=\"Curved Text Paths\" width=\"99\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ShapePaths.webp 420w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ShapePaths-286x300.webp 286w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 99px) 100vw, 99px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Several Beta WordArt styles use mathematical path rendering to curve your text along a shape:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Arch Up &#8211;<\/strong> Text curves upward along a circular arc.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Arch Down &#8211;<\/strong> Text curves downward along a circular arc.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Wavy &#8211;<\/strong> Characters dynamically tilt with a rolling sine wave.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Zig-Zag &#8211;<\/strong> Sharp 45-degree triangle wave bounces between letters.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Triangle &#8211;<\/strong> Text scales upward to a massive central peak.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Beta WordArt Beta WordArt generates decorative text as high-fidelity PNG images using a hardware-accelerated Canvas 2D pipeline. The output is pixel-perfect across all browsers, PDFs, and physical prints &#8211; what you see on screen is exactly what you get in your exported document. Inserting Beta WordArt To insert Beta WordArt: Go to Insert &gt; WordArt [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1107,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[15],"class_list":["post-1104","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-wordart"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1104","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1104"}],"version-history":[{"count":19,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1104\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1134,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1104\/revisions\/1134"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1107"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1104"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1104"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}